{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:07 2026-07-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:07 2026-07-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:07 2026-07-19 HKT</p><p>葵芳新都會廣場發生火警。今日（19日）早上8時56分，位於興芳路223號的新都會廣場2期辦公大樓，一部放於25樓走廊的吹風機突然冒煙起火。2名保安員帶備滅火筒上樓灌救將火救熄，但兩人吸入濃煙不適，需送院治理。</p><p>據了解，事發時25樓樓層一社福機構的職員發現火警，於是通知樓下商場保安員。兩名分別姓鄧(43歲)及姓何(35歲)男職員隨即帶同滅火筒上樓救火，但走廊濃煙密佈，兩人吸入濃煙不適。消防員其後接報到場，火勢已熄滅，沒有其他人受傷及毋須疏散，案件沒有可疑。</p><img alt=\"新都會廣場2保安員吸入濃煙不適送院。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/895303abc6cada4b02cbded9f721c88a/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_51_19.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a5452e591f54258d7661a48382e87296/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_51_19_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"新都會廣場2保安員吸入濃煙不適送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/81c3145f08ee706ff392c3b30ce2b956/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_51_19_4_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0249528323c28f40c51b647d973e5223/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_51_19_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/03fbaf9e61de0aa917155d8e865bea8b/2026-07/1_2_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是新都會廣場2期辦公大樓，一部擺放在25樓走廊的吹風機冒煙起火。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a23808dff40cde61c3d20e045e62394f/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_49_46_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/47cff1da3bdc4bf692e402ba23d360e2/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_49_46_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"新都會廣場2期辦公大樓發生火警。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/24108f921ba0568e9a8f39f0d07f6f51/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_49_46.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員接報到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/40921f59a6e0edcfbf96f635ec2d8163/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_51_19_5_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"25樓同款吹風機冒煙起火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c1f34d2dab912818b2ded47e9f3c112c/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_49_45_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b0b54e6026f3052f4a24e295f95e4876/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_49_45.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9bce9b8fea3c8403cf90844ffc5811fb/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-19_at_09_52_38.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-19T05:18:15.639746+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}